<view class="screen topic-page"><view class="topic-page__inner"><view class="skeleton topic-page__skeleton" wx:if="{{loading}}"></view><view class="state-panel" wx:elif="{{failed}}"><view class="state-panel__mark">!</view><text class="state-panel__title">知识点详情没有加载出来</text><text class="state-panel__copy">请返回知识图谱重新选择知识点。</text></view><block wx:else><view class="topic-page__head"><text class="topic-page__eyebrow">知识点</text><text class="topic-page__title">{{topic.label}}</text><text class="topic-page__status topic-page__status--{{topic.status}}">{{topic.statusLabel}}</text></view><view class="topic-page__details surface"><view class="topic-page__row"><text>掌握依据</text><text>{{topic.evidence}}</text></view><view class="topic-page__row"><text>前置知识</text><text>{{topic.prerequisites}}</text></view><view class="topic-page__row"><text>图谱核心度</text><text>{{topic.contribution}}</text></view></view><text class="topic-page__notice">学习计划功能正在接入，当前不能直接将知识点加入候选。</text></block></view></view>
